                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Connect customer opportunities with business goals such as growth, retention, revenue, or operational efficiency.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Identify initiatives that create value for both customers and the organization.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Validate important roadmap decisions using measurable evidence whenever possible.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4 text-center">
