                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Group related initiatives into strategic themes or product objectives.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Balance quick improvements with longer-term strategic investments.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Reassess priorities when new information changes the expected value of an initiative.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

